{
    "title": "Bumpy \u2013 International Dating",
    "description": "FIND YOUR INTERNATIONAL SOULMATE\r\n\r\nBumpy is an international dating app for people who want to meet real people to make long-term relationships in over 150 countries. Explore over 100 cultures and languages to find your soulmate among individuals from diverse backgrounds.\r\n\r\nInclusive Relationships for Everyone\r\nAt Bumpy, we believe in love for all. Our platform warmly welcomes the LGBTQ+ community, providing a safe and supportive space for gay individuals seeking long-term relationships. Connect with people who share your values and are looking for genuine, lasting connections just like you.\r\n\r\nSafety is paramount in dating apps: 90% of Bumpy users are verified, ensuring genuine connections. Chat in 100+ languages, thanks to automatic translations. Say goodbye to language barriers and meet new people effortlessly.\r\n\r\nNo limits to your connections \u2013 experience diverse cultures from Asia to Europe, Africa to North America. You can choose a continent for international dating or choose local dating. Express yourself with a detailed profile showcasing your interests and religion. Stand out and connect with like-minded individuals.\r\n\r\nBumpy prioritizes trust and safety in dating apps, offering measures like photo verification and spam detection. Feel secure as you connect with new people.\r\n\r\nFind international dating opportunities globally on Bumpy. Chat and flirt safely with the Bumpy date app, all while making new friends.\r\n\r\nChoose where to meet people:\r\n\r\n*Africa\r\n*Asia\r\n*Europe\r\n*North America\r\n*Oceania\r\n*South America\r\nor choose local dating.\r\n\r\nTrust safety with Bumpy:\r\n\r\n* Manual photo verification\r\n* User verification limits\r\n* Scam detection\r\n* Strong customer support\r\n\r\nInstall Bumpy for international love and to meet new people.\r\n\r\nUnite with Black, Asian, Latino, and other singles. Chat, flirt, and make new friends safely with the Bumpy date app.\r\n\r\nSearch by age and location. See verified profiles globally for safer dating and to meet new people.\r\n\r\nUpgrade to Gold for unlimited access in the best international dating app - Bumpy. Make new friends, meet new people, and find love around the world.\r\n\r\nStay updated:\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/bumpy.app/\r\n\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/bumpyworld\r\n\r\nContact us at: support@bumpy.app.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://bumpy.dating/terms.html",
